<title>USA: AG Associates names Favero CFO.</title>
<headline>AG Associates names Favero CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Associates said it appointed Dennis Favero, 55, vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Favero brings over 25 years of financial management experience to his new position at AG Associates. Most recently, Favero served as vice president of operations and CFO at Triquest Design Automation Inc.</p>
<p>It was not immediately known whether Favero was replacing someone or filling a new position.</p>
</text>
